		font-size: 27rpx;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	/* ---------------- 视觉优化 ---------------- */
	.header {
		background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #2b6cff, #5f92ff);
	}

	.stat-row {
		margin: 26rpx 24rpx 0 24rpx;
		padding: 24rpx 0;
